{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51263","headline":"摩多楼子 · 李白","name":"摩多楼子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"从戎向边北，远行辞密亲。\n借问阴山侯，还知塞上人。\n（以上《万首唐人绝句》。\n又《乐府诗集》作无名氏）（按影宋本《乐府诗集》卷五一收《阳春曲》，卷七八收《摩多楼子》，皆不署作者名，但紧接李白诗後，於例并非李白诗。\n汲古阁刊本目录於《阳春曲》下署「无名氏」，可证。\n今人校点本於《摩多楼子》下据王琦《李太白集》补「李白」二字，尤误，王琦已云《乐府诗集》作无名氏。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51263.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51263","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}